            ["Expansion03Main_Expansion03/MRQS_E03_040_Dungeon01.Story!Expansion03!MRQS_E03_040_Dungeon01_Group02_Step02_FollowCharacter01_StepDescription"] = "Follow Tinker Bell to the first Crystal Cavern.",
